        "type": "static_text",
        "text": "Wonderful! Let me tell you what makes TravelBucks special. You'll get access to wholesale travel pricing - we're talking 50-70% off hotels, resorts, cruises, and vacation packages. Our members save an average of $2,000 per year on travel. You get a dedicated concierge team - that's us - available 24/7. No blackout dates, no restrictions. Plus exclusive members-only deals every week. The best part? Your activation fee today is just $149, and that gives you a full year of unlimited access."
